# Modern-corpus ladder (2026-10-03 batch): the per-row prediction dumps are
# multi-gigabyte (Gotham's uncapped run alone is 27 GB) and are stored on the
# local heavy-results volume; the summaries, per-seed metrics and the submission
# package ship instead, and every file can be regenerated by the scripts.
